      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Willowrush Verge on turn 1 with no Forest/Island in play only produces {U}, preventing the turn 1 Gene Pollinator ({G}) cast. Botanical Sanctum enters untapped when you control ≤2 other lands and produces both {G} and {U}, enabling the turn 1 Gene Pollinator.",
