    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Choosing Island for Multiversal Passage is suboptimal. The hand is green-heavy (Gene Pollinator costs {G}, Nature's Rhythm costs {X}{G}{G}) and Botanical Sanctum already provides {U}. Choosing Forest would enable Willowrush Verge to produce {G} in addition to {U}, and would allow casting Gene Pollinator turn 1 if willing to pay 2 life. Island is redundant with Botanical Sanctum for blue mana.",
      "action_taken": "Chose Island as the basic land type for Multiversal Passage",
      "better_line": "Choose Forest for Multiversal Passage. This enables Willowrush Verge to tap for {G} (needs Forest or Island), better supports the green-heavy hand, and could allow a turn 1 Gene Pollinator if paying 2 life. Blue mana is already covered by Botanical Sanctum and Willowrush Verge's unconditional {U}.",
