    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Leyline of Resonance costs 2RR which is expensive, but with only 1 Mountain and 2 Hired Claws (which likely produce red mana when tapped), it could potentially be cast in a turn or two. More importantly, Leyline of Resonance has incredible synergy with this deck - it copies any instant/sorcery targeting a single creature you control. With 3 Slickshot Show-Offs and 3 Turn Inside Outs plus Full Bore, Leyline would double all combat tricks AND each copy would trigger Slickshot's +2/+0 ability again. This creates massive burst damage potential. However, at 2RR with only 1 Mountain currently, it may be too slow. A third Turn Inside Out could be the discard instead since having 3 copies is redundant, but the Leyline's ceiling is much higher if it resolves.",
