      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Gem25F Gramps declined to cast Mockingbird, which could copy Spider Manifestation (a 2/2 with reach and mana ability) for X=2 (3 mana total). With Botanical Sanctum, two Willowrush Verges, and two Gene Pollinators available for mana, they had plenty of resources to cast it. At 9 life facing two Hired Claws that deal extra damage on attack, developing the board is critical. A flying copy of Spider Manifestation would provide both an attacker and a blocker. Additionally, Nature's Rhythm could be cast from the graveyard via Harmonize, potentially tutoring a powerful creature to stabilize. Passing on both options wastes mana and tempo in a losing position.",
